# Git Workflow (L1)

- Never force-push to `main`/`master`
- Never skip hooks unless the user explicitly requests
- Never commit secrets, `.env`, or `**/secrets/**`
- Never run `git commit` unless the user explicitly asks
- Branch naming: `feat/<topic>`, `fix/<topic>`, `chore/<topic>`
- Commits: Conventional Commits (`feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`)
- Include Handoff updates in the same commit as related work when committing

See `docs/runbooks/git-setup.md` for details.
